      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_02",
      "hash64": "F616E5094F612D4D",
      "text": "那我們就在帳篷裡\\n等待有霧的夜晚吧。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_03",
      "hash64": "F616E4094F612B9A",
      "text": "時間應該差不多了。\\n助手，調查就拜託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳囉。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_poke_01",
      "hash64": "AA2CC08F9F94C910",
      "text": "拍到照片了呀！\\n我看看……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_01",
      "hash64": "3BDDBC0B859F461C",
      "text": "是模仿寶可夢樹才怪！\\n在霧裡應該很容易把牠誤認成樹吧！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_02",
      "hash64": "3BDDBF0B859F4B35",
      "text": "是蠟燭寶可夢燭光靈！\\n飄盪在黑夜中的燈火看起來很夢幻呢！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_03",
      "hash64": "3BDDBE0B859F4982",
      "text": "這應該是寧靜寶可夢迷布莉姆吧！\\n牠在靜謐的森林裡看起來過得很舒適！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_04",
      "hash64": "3BDDB90B859F4103",
      "text": "岩石寶可夢小拳石！\\n要小心別被牠絆倒了！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_05",
      "hash64": "3BDDB80B859F3F50",
      "text": "是毒蜥寶可夢夜盜火蜥！\\n牠是在黑暗中伺機偷襲獵物吧？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_06",
      "hash64": "3BDDBB0B859F4469",
      "text": "鍬形蟲寶可夢鍬農炮蟲！\\n巨大的顎拍起來還真好看！！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_07",
      "hash64": "3BDDBA0B859F42B6",
      "text": "是螢火蟲寶可夢甜甜螢！\\n聽說牠跟電螢蟲感情很好喔。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_08",
      "hash64": "3BDDC50B859F5567",
      "text": "這應該是……橡實寶可夢橡實果吧！？\\n一時之間我還以為是樹果呢！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_09",
      "hash64": "3BDDC40B859F53B4",
      "text": "是吐絲寶可夢圓絲蛛！\\n牠是正想把絲黏到樹上嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_10",
      "hash64": "3BDA370B859C2E46",
      "text": "貪吃寶可夢貪心栗鼠！\\n也許牠正在從樹上找食物呢！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_11",
      "hash64": "3BDA380B859C2FF9",
      "text": "是浮萍寶可夢蓮葉童子呢！\\n牠輕輕漂浮的樣子看起來真悠閒！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_12",
      "hash64": "3BDA350B859C2AE0",
      "text": "電魚寶可夢麻麻小魚！\\n這麼小一隻，真虧[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳能找到牠！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_13",
      "hash64": "3BDA360B859C2C93",
      "text": "這是螢火蟲寶可夢電螢蟲吧！\\n聽說牠會用屁股上的光畫出記號喔。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_14",
      "hash64": "3BDA3B0B859C3512",
      "text": "渡魂寶可夢夜巡靈……！\\n在夜裡遇到牠還真是有氣氛啊！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_15",
      "hash64": "3BDA3C0B859C36C5",
      "text": "是貓頭鷹寶可夢咕咕！\\n真希望有一天能拍到牠換腳的樣子啊。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_16",
      "hash64": "3BDA390B859C31AC",
      "text": "哦哦！是螢火蟲寶可夢\\n電螢蟲和甜甜螢！\\r\\n牠們倆的合照看起來真登對！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_17",
      "hash64": "3BDA3A0B859C335F",
      "text": "是螢火蟲寶可夢甜甜螢！\\n跟牠在一起的電螢蟲\\r\\n也許是來找牠見面的呢！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokeget_18",
      "hash64": "3BDA3F0B859C3BDE",
      "text": "是螢火蟲寶可夢電螢蟲！\\n牠也許是來找\\r\\n跟牠在一起的甜甜螢的呢！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokehint_01",
      "hash64": "28306E55EE018967",
      "text": "太讚了，太讚了！\\n找[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳幫忙果然是對的！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 10,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_side02_fieldwork_sazare_pokehint_02",
      "hash64": "28306F55EE018B1A",
      "text": "助手[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳拍的照片真讚呢～！\\c\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳去比較高的地方找過了嗎？\\n樹上也許也有寶可夢喔！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 2,
